# Shell scripts run on the Linux host: a Windows checkout must not turn them into CRLF
# (helm-ctl with CRLF stopped the Helm panel's status and power controls, 10-24 to 10-28).
*.sh text eol=lf
AetherionHelm/deploy/helm-ctl text eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted. Git guessed the Gnomon melodies (*.nbm) were text,
# and a Windows checkout with autocrlf turned them into broken files in the build tree (2026-11-02).
*.nbm binary
*.nbs binary
*.nbt binary
*.schem binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
